        }
      }
    },
    "privacy.account.body": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spog asks for no email address and no password. For leaderboards, our server recognizes your player through the anonymous installation identifier, and keeps your catches: the model, the country, the date and the points â€” never your photos, unless you agreed to share them for training. The handle you choose is visible to the other players in your league. Sign in with Apple is optional: it is only used to get your collection back on another device, and Spog receives nothing from Apple but an anonymous identifier, neither your name nor your email. You can delete your account at any time in Settings."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spog ne demande ni adresse e-mail ni mot de passe. Pour les classements, notre serveur reconnaÃ®t ton joueur grÃ¢ce Ã  l'identifiant d'installation anonyme, et conserve tes prises : le modÃ¨le, le pays, la date et les points â€” jamais tes photos, sauf si tu as acceptÃ© de les confier Ã  l'entraÃ®nement. Le pseudo que tu choisis est visible des autres joueurs de ta ligue. Sign in with Apple est facultatif : il sert uniquement Ã  retrouver ta collection sur un autre appareil, et Spog ne reÃ§oit d'Apple qu'un identifiant anonyme, ni ton nom ni ton e-mail. Tu peux supprimer ton compte Ã  tout moment dans les rÃ©glages."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "privacy.account.title": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No account"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pas de compte"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "privacy.collect.body": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spog collects the photos you take in the app, the country you spot in, and the city name if you turn location on. Each identification also carries two anonymous identifiers: the device identifier provided by Apple, and an installation identifier drawn at random by the app and stored in your iPhone's keychain, which survives a reinstall. They are used only to count your scans and renders for the day, to cap how many requests can be made and to prevent abuse. They are tied to no identity, and our server keeps only a fingerprint of them, along with what you used that day. Nothing else: no advertising identifier, no behavioral tracking, no third-party analytics."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spog collecte les photos que tu prends dans l'app, le pays oÃ¹ tu repÃ¨res tes voitures, et le nom de la ville si tu actives la localisation. Chaque identification emporte aussi deux identifiants anonymes : celui de l'appareil, fourni par Apple, et un identifiant d'installation tirÃ© au sort par l'app et rangÃ© dans le trousseau de ton iPhone, qui survit Ã  une rÃ©installation. Ils servent uniquement Ã  dÃ©compter tes scans et tes rendus du jour, Ã  limiter le nombre de requÃªtes et Ã  prÃ©venir les abus. Ils ne sont rattachÃ©s Ã  aucune identitÃ©, et notre serveur n'en conserve qu'une empreinte, avec ce que tu as utilisÃ© dans la journÃ©e. Rien d'autre : aucun identifiant publicitaire, aucun pistage comportemental, aucun outil de mesure tiers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "privacy.collect.title": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What Spog collects"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce que Spog collecte"
          }
        }
      }
    },
